<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE-Wolters H1 net 244 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Wolters H1 net 244 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1997.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)		   3.57  vs    2.97</p>
<p>    Net profit				 244     vs  202</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected business publisher Wolters Kluwer to report a first-half net profit from ordinary operations of 235-253 million guilders with the consensus forecast at 245 million.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billions)			   2.42  vs    2.02</p>
<p>    Operating costs (billions)	     1.90  vs    1.61</p>
<p>Operating profit before</p>
<p>    amortisation of goodwill	     520     vs  408</p>
<p>    Amortisation of goodwill		50     vs   32</p>
<p>Operating profit after</p>
<p>    amortisation of goodwill	     470     vs  376</p>
<p>    Interest charge			  102     vs   82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   368     vs  294</p>
<p>    Tax					  124     vs   88</p>
<p>    Net profit before extraordinaries  244     vs  206</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		    nil     vs    4 charge</p>
<p>WOLTERS KLUWER COSTS IN DETAIL --</p>
<p>    Materials/external costs	   1,131     vs  975</p>
<p>    Personnel				  708     vs  585</p>
<p>    Depreciation				62     vs   50</p>
<p>    Total operating costs (billions)     1.90  vs    1.61</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
